   read:'Background, not an AI signal. The decline is forty years old and has been flat at about 10% since 2022. The occupations most exposed to AI (software, finance, professional services) are barely unionised, so this series would not register a loss of leverage there. No readings plotted between 1983 and 2000 (dotted).',
